# =====================================================================
# Build context for the ncmu-nginx multi-stage image is the repo root
# (compose `context: .`), but stage1 only needs ncmu-spa/ source and
# stage2 only needs docker/nginx/. Ignore everything, re-include just
# those two trees, then drop heavy/generated subdirs — the repo root
# otherwise holds dify/fastgpt/pg data we never want in the context.
# =====================================================================
*
!ncmu-spa
!docker

# Heavy / generated content inside the re-included paths
ncmu-spa/node_modules
ncmu-spa/dist
ncmu-spa/.vite
ncmu-spa/playwright-report
ncmu-spa/test-results
**/*.log
